# A fourth Russian story: read it all yourself
subtitle: "Read a note from Masha about yesterday, today and tomorrow, built only from lessons 1–39, page by page, hear it line by line, test what you understood, and see what you can do now."
thumb: "band \"Read it all yourself, a fourth time\" note \"lessons 31–39, 1 story\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Please say it again in Russian: повторите","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/41-russian-say-again.cast"}

## A fourth Russian story: read it all yourself
level: basic
heading: false

    glossed s1 "Приве́т! Вчера́ я была́ в го́роде." gloss ["hi","yesterday","I","was","in","town"] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s2 "Бы́ло о́чень хо́лодно." gloss ["(it) was","very","cold"] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s3 "Я была́ в магази́не и в ба́нке." gloss ["I","was","in","shop","and","in","bank"] show_gloss after x 500 y 250 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s4 "Ве́чером я пила́ ко́фе с молоко́м." gloss ["in the evening","I","drank","coffee","with","milk"] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s5 "Пото́м я смотре́ла фильм с бра́том." gloss ["then","I","watched","film","with","brother"] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s6 "Сего́дня мне ну́жно рабо́тать." gloss ["today","to me","needed","to work"] show_gloss after x 500 y 250 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s7 "А за́втра бу́дет тепло́!" gloss ["and","tomorrow","will be","warm"] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s8 "У́тром я бу́ду чита́ть, а днём я иду́ в парк." gloss ["in the morning","I","will","read","and","in the day","I","go","to","park"] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 960 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s9 "Ты хо́чешь в парк? Пока́!" gloss ["you","want","to","park","bye"] show_gloss after x 500 y 250 width 960 font_size 46 hidden true
