    grid grid gap 18 columns 3 fit.h 430 fit.w 950 fit.x 25 fit.y 190 hidden true

A: Masha has written you a note about yesterday, today and tomorrow.
    draw open_woman

A: Can you read it all on your own?
    draw open_note

    erase open_woman open_note

A: Every word comes from lessons one to thirty-nine. Read each short page first, and tap any word you're unsure of.
    draw s1 s2 s3

B: Приве́т! Вчера́ я была́ в го́роде.
    highlight s1_words color #c9871a

B: Бы́ло о́чень хо́лодно.
    highlight s2_words color #c9871a

B: Я была́ в магази́не и в ба́нке.
    highlight s3_words color #c9871a

A: Вчера́ я была́, yesterday I was: была́ ends in а because Masha is a woman, as in lesson eighteen.
    highlight s1_w_4 color #b5482e part а$ effect pulse

B: Бы́ло о́чень хо́лодно: it was very cold. The weather takes бы́ло, from lesson thirty-three.
    highlight s2_words color #c9871a

A: Each place she was, в го́роде, в магази́не, в ба́нке, adds е, as in lesson thirty-four.
    highlight s1_w_6 s3_w_4 s3_w_7 color #d0865f part е$ effect pulse

    erase s1 s2 s3

A: On to the second page: the evening, and today. Read it first, then listen.
    draw s4 s5 s6

B: Ве́чером я пила́ ко́фе с молоко́м.
    highlight s4_words color #c9871a

B: Пото́м я смотре́ла фильм с бра́том.
    highlight s5_words color #c9871a

B: Сего́дня мне ну́жно рабо́тать.
    highlight s6_words color #c9871a

A: Ве́чером, in the evening: one word for a time of day, from lesson thirty-seven.
    highlight s4_w_1 color #c9871a

B: Ко́фе с молоко́м, coffee with milk: after с, молоко́ takes ом, the with-ending of lesson thirty-six.
    highlight s4_w_6 color #2a7f86 part ом$ effect pulse

A: Я смотре́ла фильм, I watched a film: the past of смотре́ть, again with the а of a woman, from lesson thirty-one.
    highlight s5_w_3 color #b5482e part а$ effect pulse

B: And с бра́том, with my brother Ivan: брат takes ом too.
    highlight s5_w_6 color #2a7f86 part ом$ effect pulse

A: Сего́дня мне ну́жно рабо́тать: today I have to work. Word for word, to me it's needed, from lesson thirty-five.
    highlight s6_words color #c9871a

    erase s4 s5 s6

B: And the last page: tomorrow, and a question for you.
    draw s7 s8 s9

B: А за́втра бу́дет тепло́!
    highlight s7_words color #c9871a

B: У́тром я бу́ду чита́ть, а днём я иду́ в парк.
    highlight s8_words color #c9871a

B: Ты хо́чешь в парк? Пока́!
    highlight s9_words color #c9871a

A: За́втра бу́дет тепло́: tomorrow it will be warm, with бу́дет from lesson thirty-two.
    highlight s7_w_2 s7_w_3 s7_w_4 color #c9871a

B: У́тром я бу́ду чита́ть: in the morning I will read. Бу́ду, then чита́ть just as it is.
    highlight s8_w_1 s8_w_2 s8_w_3 s8_w_4 color #c9871a

A: Днём я иду́ в парк: in the day I'm going to the park. Иду́ works for a plan too, like I'm going in English.
    highlight s8_w_6 s8_w_7 s8_w_8 s8_w_9 s8_w_10 color #c9871a

B: Going to, with в, as in lesson twenty-seven. Парк is a he-word, so it stays as it is, like в рестора́н.
    highlight s8_w_9 s8_w_10 color #c9871a

A: Last, ты хо́чешь в парк? Do you want to come to the park? Masha is asking you.
    highlight s9_words color #c9871a

    erase s7 s8 s9

    quiz "Где Ма́ша была́ вчера́? Where was Masha yesterday? Pick one." reveal.text "Вчера́ я была́ в го́роде." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Now five questions on the note, from memory.
        right: In town: вчера́ я была́ в го́роде, in the very first line.
        wrong: Look back at the first line: вчера́ я была́…
        * в Ло́ндоне
        + в го́роде
        * на вокза́ле

    erase question_1_stamp

    quiz "What was the weather like yesterday? Pick one." reveal.text "Бы́ло о́чень хо́лодно." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Very cold. Warm is for tomorrow.
        wrong: Warm is for tomorrow. What was it like yesterday?
        * Бы́ло жа́рко.
        + Бы́ло о́чень хо́лодно.
        * Бы́ло тепло́.

    erase question_2_stamp

    ask "Masha drank coffee with milk. Type the missing word: ко́фе с …" answer ["молоком"] reveal.text "ко́фе с молоко́м" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Молоко́м: after с, молоко́ takes ом.
        wrong: Start from молоко́ and add the with-ending, ом.

    erase question_3_stamp

    quiz "Who did Masha watch the film with? Pick one." reveal.text "Я смотре́ла фильм с бра́том." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 56 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: With her brother, Ivan.
        wrong: Not mum, and not a sister. Who is Ivan?
        * с ма́мой
        * с сестро́й
        + с бра́том

    erase question_4_stamp

    quiz "What will Masha do tomorrow morning? Pick one." reveal.text "У́тром я бу́ду чита́ть." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Read: у́тром я бу́ду чита́ть, and then the park.
        wrong: Work is today, and the bank was yesterday.
        * Она́ бу́дет рабо́тать.
        + Она́ бу́дет чита́ть.
        * Она́ была́ в ба́нке.

    erase question_5_stamp

    draw score_woman

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase score_woman

    draw grid

A: Now look back at lessons thirty-one to thirty-nine. You can say what you did yesterday, and what you will do tomorrow.
    highlight L31 L32 color #c9871a

B: You can talk about the weather, say where you were in town, and what you can and must do.
    highlight L33 L34 L35 color #c9871a

A: You can order your coffee with milk, and say what you do in the morning and the evening.
    highlight L36 L37 color #c9871a

B: And you can say what hurts, and ask whose it is. Masha's note used much of it, and not one word in it was new.
    highlight L38 L39 color #c9871a

    erase grid

A: Masha asked you a question, so answer her out loud: да, хочу́! Yes, I want to.
    draw end_woman end_text

B: Хорошо́! Пока́!
    highlight end_woman color #c9871a

